      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "\"Foreign aid isn't a handout, it's a lifeline. When we invest in the world's most vulnerable populations, we're not just saving lives, we're saving our own. The notion that we can turn a blind eye to global suffering and expect to reap the benefits of a more peaceful, prosperous world is a moral luxury we can no longer afford. By providing aid, we're not just doing good, we're doing right – and it's our responsibility as a global leader to do so.\"",
